 usr.sbin/lume-configurar/lume-tema.sh         | 29 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../tema/org.kde.kglobalaccel.service         |  7 +++++
 4 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 usr.sbin/lume-configurar/tema/org.kde.kglobalaccel.service

